37
00:01:35,688 --> 00:01:37,717
Agora, a principal mudança.

38
00:01:37,717 --> 00:01:40,875
Hoje, a Lei de Crimes Ambientais, de mil novecentos

39
00:01:40,875 --> 00:01:44,349
